# Normalize line endings so the byte-for-byte worklog append-only invariant
# (AGENTS.md "Worklog Governance") does not depend on any machine's
# core.autocrlf / checkout configuration. This repository is LF throughout;
# a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true previously smudged every text file to
# CRLF on checkout, which makes a working-copy byte comparison against the
# committed blob fail for reasons unrelated to the content.
* text=auto eol=lf
AGENT_WORKLOG.md text eol=lf
